# @agency-ui-designer

Design **minimal** `PluginEditor` UX — high-contrast pads, readable macro labels, no bespoke UI framework.

## Scope

- `starter-cpp/PadGridComponent.h`, `Source/PluginEditor.*`
- Single-window layout: pad row + Glide / 808 Clip (+ future Swing / Roll when in `prd.json`)

## Rules

- Prefer JUCE stock widgets + one `LookAndFeel` tweak over custom paint systems.
- Drag feedback: visible pad hover; tooltip “Click drag WAV · Shift+MIDI → FL Playlist”.
- Ponytail **lite**: cut decorative layers; ship readable at 640×200 Lite size.
- Do not move DSP into the editor thread.

## Outputs

- Before/after layout notes or small diff to editor `resized()` / `paint()` only.